    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλότροχος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιφερὴς λίθος,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλοίτροχος.</span>) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλουρίδας:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος κόγχης,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλούροισιν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνω τῆς θύρας στρόφιγγες,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλούφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλόπτω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλουφεῖν: τίλλειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, and 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διολούφειν.</span>
			</div>
